{
 "id": "seg3",
 "title": "账户就是输入",
 "pill": 3,
 "total": 135.5,
 "lines": [
  {
   "id": "seg3-00",
   "text": "Solana 程序拿到的每一个账户，都是用户输入。",
   "spoken": "Solana 程序拿到的每一个账户，都是用户输入。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep13/audio/lines/seg3-00.mp3",
   "start": 1.6,
   "dur": 3.888,
   "speechStart": 1.698,
   "speechEnd": 4.65
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-01",
   "text": "第一件要查的，是 owner。这个账户，是不是归本程序所有。",
   "spoken": "第一件要查的，是 owner。这个账户，是不是归本程序所有。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep13/audio/lines/seg3-01.mp3",
   "start": 5.708,
   "dur": 5.664,
   "speechStart": 5.806,
   "speechEnd": 10.529
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-02",
   "text": "第二件，是签名。管理员操作，必须检查管理员账户签了名。",
   "spoken": "第二件，是签名。管理员操作，必须检查管理员账户签了名。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep13/audio/lines/seg3-02.mp3",
   "start": 11.592,
   "dur": 6.456,
   "speechStart": 11.69,
   "speechEnd": 17.211
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-03",
   "text": "第三件，是类型。两种账户结构相同，攻击者就能拿一种冒充另一种。要靠判别字段区分。",
   "spoken": "第三件，是类型。两种账户结构相同，攻击者就能拿一种冒充另一种。要靠判别字段区分。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep13/audio/lines/seg3-03.mp3",
   "start": 18.268,
   "dur": 9.504,
   "speechStart": 18.366,
   "speechEnd": 26.935
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-04",
   "text": "第四件，是跨程序调用的目标。program id 由调用者传进来，就必须核对。",
   "spoken": "第四件，是跨程序掉用的目标。program id 由掉用者传进来，就必须核对。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep13/audio/lines/seg3-04.mp3",
   "start": 27.992,
   "dur": 7.152,
   "speechStart": 28.09,
   "speechEnd": 34.29
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-05",
   "text": "第五件，是系统账户。要用带校验的读取方式。Wormhole 缺的就是这一件。",
   "spoken": "第五件，是系统账户。要用带较验的读取方式。Wormhole 缺的就是这一件。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep13/audio/lines/seg3-05.mp3",
   "start": 35.364,
   "dur": 7.224,
   "speechStart": 35.462,
   "speechEnd": 41.757
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-06",
   "text": "更隐蔽的一种，是信任链没有终点。",
   "spoken": "更隐蔽的一种，是信任链没有终点。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep13/audio/lines/seg3-06.mp3",
   "start": 42.808,
   "dur": 3.456,
   "speechStart": 42.906,
   "speechEnd": 45.417
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-07",
   "text": "2022 年 3 月的 Cashio，存抵押品时，只检查了各个账户互相一致。",
   "spoken": "2022 年 3 月的 Cashio，存抵押品时，只检查了各个账户互相一致。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep13/audio/lines/seg3-07.mp3",
   "start": 46.484,
   "dur": 6.384,
   "speechStart": 46.582,
   "speechEnd": 52.034
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-08",
   "text": "铸币检查没有把 mint 字段，锚定到一个可信的根。",
   "spoken": "铸币检查没有把 mint 字段，锚定到一个可信的根。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep13/audio/lines/seg3-08.mp3",
   "start": 53.088,
   "dur": 4.56,
   "speechStart": 53.186,
   "speechEnd": 56.817
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-09",
   "text": "攻击者伪造了整条账户链，用没有价值的代币，铸出约 20 亿枚 CASH。",
   "spoken": "攻击者伪造了整条账户链，用没有价值的代币，铸出约 20 亿枚 CASH。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep13/audio/lines/seg3-09.mp3",
   "start": 57.868,
   "dur": 5.688,
   "speechStart": 57.966,
   "speechEnd": 62.728
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-10",
   "text": "损失的估计，rekt.news 约 4800 万美元，CertiK 约 5280 万美元。",
   "spoken": "损失的估计，rekt.news 约 4800 万美元，CertiK 约 5280 万美元。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep13/audio/lines/seg3-10.mp3",
   "start": 63.776,
   "dur": 7.176,
   "speechStart": 63.874,
   "speechEnd": 70.1
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-11",
   "text": "账户之间再一致，也要有一端，落在硬编码的地址，或本程序的 PDA 上。",
   "spoken": "账户之间再一致，也要有一端，落在硬编码的地址，或本程序的 PDA 上。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep13/audio/lines/seg3-11.mp3",
   "start": 71.172,
   "dur": 6.336,
   "speechStart": 71.27,
   "speechEnd": 76.686
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-12",
   "text": "PDA 要用规范的 bump。跨程序调用之后，要再次加载账户，不用内存里的旧数据。",
   "spoken": "PDA 要用规范的 bump。跨程序掉用之后，要再次加载账户，不用内存里的旧数据。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep13/audio/lines/seg3-12.mp3",
   "start": 77.728,
   "dur": 7.656,
   "speechStart": 77.826,
   "speechEnd": 84.549
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-13",
   "text": "Anchor 框架的账户约束，能自动做完大部分检查。但约束是开发者写的，漏写一个，就等于没有。",
   "spoken": "Anchor 框架的账户约束，能自动做完大部分检查。但约束是开发者写的，漏写一个，就等于没有。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep13/audio/lines/seg3-13.mp3",
   "start": 85.604,
   "dur": 8.904,
   "speechStart": 85.702,
   "speechEnd": 93.675
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-14",
   "text": "签名的有效期，也是一种输入。",
   "spoken": "签名的有效期，也是一种输入。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep13/audio/lines/seg3-14.mp3",
   "start": 94.728,
   "dur": 3.192,
   "speechStart": 94.826,
   "speechEnd": 97.088
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-15",
   "text": "2026 年 4 月，按 Chainalysis 的分析，Drift 损失约 2.85 亿美元。",
   "spoken": "2026 年 4 月，按 Chainalysis 的分析，Drift 损失约 2.85 亿美元。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep13/audio/lines/seg3-15.mp3",
   "start": 98.14,
   "dur": 6.144,
   "speechStart": 98.238,
   "speechEnd": 103.452
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-16",
   "text": "它的安全委员会，五个人里两人签名就能放行。迁移到新配置后，时间锁为零。",
   "spoken": "它的安全委员会，五个人里两人签名就能放行。迁移到新配置后，时间锁维零。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep13/audio/lines/seg3-16.mp3",
   "start": 104.504,
   "dur": 7.224,
   "speechStart": 104.602,
   "speechEnd": 110.897
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-17",
   "text": "至少两名成员，签了自己没有完全理解的审批。",
   "spoken": "至少两名成员，签了自己没有完全理解的审批。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep13/audio/lines/seg3-17.mp3",
   "start": 111.948,
   "dur": 4.368,
   "speechStart": 112.046,
   "speechEnd": 115.486
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-18",
   "text": "Solana 的签名，本来约 1 分钟就会过期。持久 nonce 让这些签名长期有效。",
   "spoken": "Solana 的签名，本来约 1 分钟就会过期。持久 nonce 让这些签名长期有效。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep13/audio/lines/seg3-18.mp3",
   "start": 116.536,
   "dur": 6.912,
   "speechStart": 116.634,
   "speechEnd": 122.596
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-19",
   "text": "Chainalysis 也说明，这些描述来自 Drift 自己的调查，未经独立验证。",
   "spoken": "Chainalysis 也说明，这些描述来自 Drift 自己的掉查，未经独立验证。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep13/audio/lines/seg3-19.mp3",
   "start": 123.668,
   "dur": 6.288,
   "speechStart": 123.766,
   "speechEnd": 129.123
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-20",
   "text": "管理操作要加时间锁，执行前再确认一次。",
   "spoken": "管理操作要加时间锁，执行前再确认一次。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep13/audio/lines/seg3-20.mp3",
